Z||000000||hutch84fierose||12-05-2001||07:59 PM||||I bought a nose from fiero conversions in windsor ontario.  I have an 84 se fiero and i heard and was told that an 85 gt nose would fit no problem and the groves match.<BR>I got the nose today took my nose off tonight and went to put it on.  First of all the inner wheel wells don't line up really well there is a space in there so they don't fit.  theres nothing to really mount it to.  I was told this was a take off bolt on deal so i figured no problem this isn't going to be a problem what has to be changed for this to fit properly????  Has anyone ever done this????<BR>Thanks for the help<BR>jon hutcheson||||reg||4
Z||000001||MrPBody||12-05-2001||08:14 PM||||Yes, you need to change the wheelwell liners.  You should also change the impact absorbing "waffle", radiator ductwork, and turn signal mounts.  And maybe some other stuff I don't know about.<BR>||||reg||1
